[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_3D_WATERMELON]
Watermelon

[l_english.MODULE_PROJECTILE_3D_WATERMELON_desc]
The watermelon, a deceptively innocent fruit: green armor and red interior, just like the bloody enemies in their uniforms.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_3D_WATERMELON]
西瓜

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PROJECTILE_3D_WATERMELON_desc]
西瓜，一个看似无害的水果：绿色的外壳和红色的内部，就像穿着军装浑身是血的敌军一样。
